{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>In their land you shall not inherit</b> — that you shall inherit your portion as one of all the tribes of Israel, and you shall have no small portion in their land at all, for the cities which were given to them were cities of refuge and serve the needs of Israel. This warning concerns the priests, and afterward he mentioned concerning the Levites: \"Among the children of Israel they shall not inherit an inheritance\" (Numbers 18:24), just as was warned concerning the priests. And our Sages expounded (Sifrei Korach 115): \"In their land you shall not inherit\" — at the time of the division of the land; \"and you shall have no portion among them\" — in the spoils; \"I am your portion\" — from My table you eat."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:06:49.314176942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}